        <activityName xml:lang="en">Polyurethane, rigid foam, market mix, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Polyurethane, rigid foam, market mix, at regional storage
pipeline transport is modelled as freight train transport.;
UUID: 29a87720-9ee8-39e1-9572-dca1d04ea0ef
This data set accounts for 1 kg of PUR at the regional storage. 45% are from import, 55% are produced in Switzerland. The imported share is weighted with a factor of 1.1. The average transport distance is 848 km. 6% are delievered by freight train, 92% by lorry and 2% by barge.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: undefined
Time period: undefined
Production volume: CH consumption of PUR: 34.8 kt (import and domestic production)
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_29a87720-9ee8-39e1-9572-dca1d04ea0ef.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
